From 79ea5fa8513a18e4f93f0a59db24df4b113fafed Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 11:33:38 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 01/13] Round 1: Add the typed score-matrix API

Add Prepared::score_matrix for row-major untraced parameters without
candidate or record JSON, its Python native method and wrapper, a model
hash accessor, a shared dispatch helper, a CRAFT_MATRIX benchmark mode,
matrix normalization in performance_pair.py and --matrix in
optimize_performance.py. Unit tests check bitwise score, status and
step equivalence with scores_json, including invalid rows, max_steps
limits, a cancel file and multiple workers.

Workload: serial (96 untraced candidates, one worker), 0.2.0 lean
scores_json before, matrix after, 11 samples per side.
Before median: 0.2595 ms. After median: 0.2091 ms. Speedup: 1.24x.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
